# Smoke-test credentials (level 3 harness tests). NEVER commit real values.
# Local: export vars in your shell (or cp this to .env, gitignored).
# CI:    Environment `smoke` secrets (never on PRs).
#
# Provider order: SMOKE_PROVIDER=zen (default) | nim (fallback).

# --- OpenCode Zen (default) ---
# Key from https://opencode.ai/auth (free models available, pay-per-use other).
# Add as secret OPENCODE_ZEN_API_KEY in the `smoke` Environment for CI.
OPENCODE_ZEN_API_KEY=
# Optional overrides (defaults shown)
# SMOKE_PROVIDER=zen
# ZEN_SMOKE_MODEL=deepseek-v4-flash-free

# --- NVIDIA NIM (fallback) ---
# Key from https://build.nvidia.com (free credits). Flaky: EOL models,
# entitlement issues — see tests/smoke/nim-pilot.ts to validate first.
# NVIDIA_API_KEY=nvapi-...
# SMOKE_PROVIDER=nim
# NIM_SMOKE_MODEL=meta/llama-3.3-70b-instruct
